  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "得bē著"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張寶明</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Liam-mi東勢拆ha̍h--ah，iáu ná leh煎魚仔，án-ne píng--過-來，nuà--過-去。「Lán先來moo-té-luh，tsiah來lim咖啡看海？」Tsit句話一直tī頭殼碗--裡huan，睏bē落眠，規暝眠眠ná做夢。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>「明仔早起公司主管會議煞倚11點，我來去lín兜接--你？」</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>「我等--你。」</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為昨hng beh暗仔tsit pha <i>LINE</i> ê對話。Hōo偉俊孤單kah睏bē ka-tsuē。Beh賭強踮眠床頂nuá，規氣起來洗tn̄g。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><!--more--><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">來到公司隔壁ê <i>LOUISA COFFEE</i>，蹛hia lim咖啡度時間等上班。「是beh按怎美淑tsiah ē順我ê意？」半煩惱半猜疑，心bē定著，thài ē管等--leh開會beh報告ê資料準備--未！連桌頂通知鈴仔tsùn kah，koh pi-pi叫，是啥代to ài一睏仔tsiah回魂tńg--來koh。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>「我到樓跤--ah。」</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>「我隨落--去。<i>Honey</i>！」</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">To iáu未11點，車駛beh到位ê時，偉俊就先<i>LINE</i>&nbsp; hōo美淑--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Haih！有夠久無khuàinn！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Haih！是有久--ah！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Eh！Lán先來去moo-té-luh好--無？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「Kán！我菜店查某是--m̄？見就beh招我去做he，kám bē-sái做真好ê朋友？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「真好ê朋友啥siâu mā ē做--得，án-ne lán心、身、靈m̄-tsiah ē相好。像lán頂kái án-ne互相享受，m̄是通體爽快？」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「今仔日，我無想就是--lah！Beh去lim咖啡--未？Lim了，無的確我就有感覺--ah！」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「講hōo定。Tuè我行--ooh！」偉俊料想美淑ē ná頂kái án-ne，使「ná siânn koh ná the」ê步數，準備beh食凊飯等--伊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">美淑選一个ē-tàng看海koh吹海風ê位，兩个人坐--落-來，m̄是練仙khà-kho̍k，就是做sán-khuì。「Lim一杯仔囝ê咖啡niâ，時間thài ē行kah hiah慢？夭壽仔--lih！」偉俊ê慾火to̍h kah拍bē hua，伸手挲美淑大腿ê tshóng-pōng，ná海風一tsūn koh一tsūn，興beh做hit種代ê心，親像窗外海湧自早就phīn-phōng溢--ah。做sán-khuì ê話koh bē-sái siunn白，kho̍k-kho̍k等美淑ê「有感覺」緊來。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「我生日beh到--ah，無所費--neh！你beh包偌濟？」美淑看時間差不多--ah，離題講。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「看你表現--啊！」偉俊知影美淑koh借機會leh huah散--ah。用話beh釣--伊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Bē堪得美淑好膽koh gâu jû ê話，一句一句tsha̍k著家己ê弱點。知美淑奸巧無單純，beh kap伊相好ê慾望koh擋bē tiâu，鼻仔摸--leh，兩粒tēnn--leh，心肝kiāu kah，m̄願kah tàn六千踮桌頂hōo--伊。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「俊--哥，後kái好--無？」美淑提著錢了sai-nai講。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「行！來tńg。」沿路lóng無koh講半句話，連落車to無講再會。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">偉俊車駛一塊仔路就停路邊，隨kā美淑ê面冊kap <i>LINE</i>&nbsp; lóng封鎖--起-來，koh喙tshoh：「Kán！啥siâu人。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隔工早起，偉俊拄提手機仔就隨koh kā美淑ê<i> LINE</i> 解鎖，看美淑有koh招--伊--無？&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9EFbcrQ0KiLgwa2M3eDFyBMb8onr0DzxmjrPbABstYbNb5WCsa5bTjFCfge6Y8sKaJuefDwv5G7LkeqJMDyJdbtmLLHD1XaPQwzWrLCwmYeW1vit5lAz4Tlw8bdA3FNykykQPQwZ0HeRZLmhobsG7mjMpOU6qVDcnHWa8jenw7OQMnDjY3mTVCo0SXA/s1424/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg9EFbcrQ0KiLgwa2M3eDFyBMb8onr0DzxmjrPbABstYbNb5WCsa5bTjFCfge6Y8sKaJuefDwv5G7LkeqJMDyJdbtmLLHD1XaPQwzWrLCwmYeW1vit5lAz4Tlw8bdA3FNykykQPQwZ0HeRZLmhobsG7mjMpOU6qVDcnHWa8jenw7OQMnDjY3mTVCo0SXA/w450-h640/344%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj-f2QYpIulkl2EZvpiG3K9qJWK985AUmIq-wbbjiPkW5nM3xLDoEY16LPuUDoT29o8ZurusED5qRUqKQxWRQrUnCXfQjUvpdIyC1xlQRJFnzZS_2PGrGp6CpqhzzNrpiuvI4Gs-USPh-6vk2HeTezgvt2c90rqOm9VJ91TCjbJq8FZOt8crXYSc7TR7w/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_08.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj-f2QYpIulkl2EZvpiG3K9qJWK985AUmIq-wbbjiPkW5nM3xLDoEY16LPuUDoT29o8ZurusED5qRUqKQxWRQrUnCXfQjUvpdIyC1xlQRJFnzZS_2PGrGp6CpqhzzNrpiuvI4Gs-USPh-6vk2HeTezgvt2c90rqOm9VJ91TCjbJq8FZOt8crXYSc7TR7w/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_08.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgj77wBRxmMCw0GWKZ7LxI1TMg4aT8gSoFz8jR8dlkzn2-o-LV_i7sF7au2J4qY-ZHuqfIcPfyDnFYkpGHXBW9JEbICZTO0XC1VvbGGUbVkk7zBDnnb_bMX9pe1XU7NZrbBBvU_3yVbt8SNOnmVmaPFHlzQK1zovyUjwe9YgxKobTNtmO98AuVwUZ7NLw/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1344%E6%9C%9F_09.jpg\" style=\"m